  "steps": [
    "Mix the peanut butter, hoisin sauce, soy sauce, lime juice, sesame oil, grated garlic, and brown sugar in a bowl until smooth. Stir in the sliced chilli if using, then set the dip aside.",
    "Prepare all the vegetables and herbs so they are ready to fill the wraps: shred the cabbage, julienne the carrot and cucumber, and thinly slice the pepper.",
    "Warm the flour tortillas one at a time in a dry pan for a few seconds per side until pliable.",
    "Lay out each tortilla and top with a lettuce leaf, a little of each vegetable, bean sprouts, coriander, and mint.",
    "Roll each one up tightly, tucking in the sides as you go. Slice in half if you want smaller snack portions.",
    "Serve immediately with the hoisin peanut dip for dunking."
  ],
